( https://albiononline.com/news/knightfall-is-here )

Adventurer,

*Knightfall* is here! This major patch expands and improves on the features=
 introduced with the *Beyond the Veil* update - and to mark the occasion, w=
e've created a brand-new trailer:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DxhLxGK0MvnA )

To celebrate the launch, we=E2=80=99re also holding a contest where you can=
 share your perfect Knightfall build. Head over to *Reddit* ( https://www.r=
eddit.com/r/albiononline/comments/138gt05/share_your_knightfall_abbey_build=
_and_win/ ) and submit yours for a chance to win!

And to keep the celebration going, we're also offering *double Twitch Drops=
* from May 8-15. These additional drops can be earned by watching any Albio=
n stream that has Drops enabled. (To learn more about Twitch Drops, click *=
here* ( https://albiononline.com/twitch ).)

Read on to learn what's new with Knightfall...

( https://albiononline.com/news/dev-talk-knightfall-abbey )

The Mists: Opportunity and Mystery
----------------------------------

Knightfall brings new features and improvements to the Mists, offering play=
ers of all types and levels a chance at big rewards. *Coffers* are treasure=
s that only reveal their location to nearby players, and *Caches* offer ind=
ividualized loot for clearing mob camps. *Knightfall Abbey* ( https://albio=
nonline.com/news/dev-talk-knightfall-abbey ) , a mysterious dungeon within =
the Mists, is an atmospheric realm of crumbling stone and beautiful stained=
-glass windows. Seek out treasures and ancient shrines for powerful buffs, =
because you'll need all the help you can get - not only against other adven=
turers, but against the former residents as well.

( https://albiononline.com/news/knightfall-is-here )

New Items, Traders, and Standing
--------------------------------

Knightfall brings brand-new items and crafting components, plus a new face =
in Brecilien, *Eralia Wayfarer* , who trades with adventurers with sufficie=
nt standing. New *Avalonian* and *Brecilien Capes* offer unique defensive c=
apabilities, *Mystic* *Owl mounts* carry you swiftly through the world, and=
 other items await your discovery. The *Roads of Avalon* have been updated =
with new enemies and pathways, with some mobs now dropping Avalonian Energy=
.

( https://albiononline.com/news/knightfall-is-here )

Major Quality-of-Life Improvements
----------------------------------

* Extensive combat balance changes
* Optional WASD movement system
* Characters' gender can be changed for Gold
* New "Travel Mode" offers transparent map overlay while traveling
* Items can now be repaired directly via the Marketplace UI
* New guild logos, Season Winner statues, and skill icons
* Major optimizations to mobile and controller gameplay
* =E2=80=A6and much more

For the complete list of changes, see the official patchnotes:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/changelog/knightfall )

