<div>
<div>
<h3>The Mists: Opportunity and Mystery</h3>

<div>Knightfall brings new features and improvements to the Mists, offering=
 players of all types and levels a chance at big rewards. <strong>Coffers</=
strong> are treasures that only reveal their location to nearby players, an=
d <strong>Caches </strong>offer individualized loot for clearing mob camps.=
 <a href=3D"https://albiononline.com/news/dev-talk-knightfall-abbey"><stron=
g>Knightfall Abbey</strong></a>, a mysterious dungeon within the Mists, is =
an atmospheric realm of crumbling stone and beautiful stained-glass windows=
. Seek out treasures and ancient shrines for powerful buffs, because you'll=
 need all the help you can get - not only against other adventurers, but ag=
ainst the former residents as well.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
