<h3>New Items, Traders, and Standing</h3>

<div>Knightfall brings brand-new items and crafting components, plus a new =
face in Brecilien, <strong>Eralia Wayfarer</strong>, who trades with advent=
urers with sufficient standing. New <strong>Avalonian</strong> and <strong>=
Brecilien Capes</strong> offer unique defensive capabilities, <strong>Mysti=
c</strong> <strong>Owl mounts </strong>carry you swiftly through the world,=
 and other items await your discovery. The <strong>Roads of Avalon</strong>=
 have been updated with new enemies and pathways, with some mobs now droppi=
ng Avalonian Energy.</div>
